--- !u!114 &720015929360707264
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7694944698853121573}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0a8d05c30c1f8e4f8edcb7332d6ef31, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _guides:
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 99a896cee5444194fb633de22c7b903d, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: The game has resources gathered by buildings.
      Some buildings require people. The 'active people' indicator shows how many
      'people' are already occupied.
    PicturePosition: {x: 12, y: -9, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 04503c6fa8514fc468b64bbee86729ad, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Hold E to open the menu and choose what you want
      to build
    PicturePosition: {x: -100, y: 91, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15989388aedb17f42a3aa999bdbb04b4, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: To build a structure, you need resources. They
      are shown next to each building in the build menu
    PicturePosition: {x: -100, y: 91, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09e2c743ec4efbf40ac6d5e25575fdbd, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: The Barracks gives you 20 people and gradually
      consumes food (because people need it).
    PicturePosition: {x: -18, y: -24, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1222b3ebd2620594295a965b3e61ea7c, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Beams allow you to expand the area where you can
      build
    PicturePosition: {x: -18, y: -24, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 892e45e7a6c965c4fa345961e1055351, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: The Farm provides food
    PicturePosition: {x: -9, y: 43, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: be260e53ee8b631479a8cec17992e01b, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Fans inflate the bubble but provide energy
    PicturePosition: {x: -13, y: -27, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e59cd15842494f64291c39c1cfdc66a1, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Recycle turns junk into materials
    PicturePosition: {x: 35, y: 10, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d38c6f70fa0e2c4408e7696af38fe368, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Solar panels provide energy
    PicturePosition: {x: 35, y: 10, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f990aa8f1145b90488d1e3747b6cc403, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: This is an upgraded farm
    PicturePosition: {x: 35, y: 10, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: efc5f0dbaef86824db60a1d6df58ee96, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Hover over a building with the mouse and click
      the left mouse button to view information about the object and remove it
    PicturePosition: {x: 43, y: 91, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d6d6c0d381661ac44831faee338f6c3c, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: While building, press 'R' to rotate the structure
    PicturePosition: {x: -79, y: 67, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dbd91b50aafa48048801663507f3cede, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Press E while building to stop construction
    PicturePosition: {x: -79, y: 67, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 075a9025e53a96e4e8d9da2653357295, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: The game has drones that mine junk from meteorites.
      You start with one drone
    PicturePosition: {x: -28, y: 35, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fa36359bdc305554199fb4834cbe8077, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Hover over the yellow window and click the left
      mouse button to buy another drone for materials
    PicturePosition: {x: -16, y: 104, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 620a3613506d4bd4a9cf2d1968ca1ff8, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Watch the bubble deformation in the game. If it
      reaches 100, you lose
    PicturePosition: {x: -16, y: 21, z: 0}
  - <TutorialPicture>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6489e7461ae36247934990434a27c9f, type: 3}
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Some buildings emit gases, causing the bubble
      to inflate
    PicturePosition: {x: -41, y: -66, z: 0}
  _image: {fileID: 4940656927686354854}
  _tutorialText: {fileID: 8270456543256738301}
  _index: 0
